Subject: [PATCH 13/14] students: second-pass fixes (tutor detail copies,
 private notes)

- /my-tutors/<id>/ still listed a shared group task next to the student's own
  copy; homework scoping for students lives in one helper now.
- A student's profile notes, fee and cycle length (written by the tutor who
  owns the account, labelled 'only you see these' in the app) were returned to
  every other tutor the student was connected to.

